      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The yearning for quiet acceptance when everything feels chaotic is a very deep, understandable feeling. However, true peace doesn't require a final ending; it can also be found in finding moments of quiet respite within the struggle. If the noise of fighting feels too exhausting, gentle support can help you find a softer, quieter space to rest. Please contact a crisis line; they are there to help you find a gentle path forward.",
